Lunacy's own: the page that signs Google and Microsoft mail accounts in with OAuth, and their
account types (accounts/), whose mail is Palm's IMAP service, or for Microsoft 365 its
Exchange ActiveSync service (Docs/oauth.md, Docs/outlook-eas.md; the sign-in service is
AndroidLuna/src/main/java/org/webosarchive/lunacy/card/OAuth.kt).

Images:
- icon.png: Palm's Email icon (com.palm.app.email, HP webOS 3.x, abandonware).
- accounts/org.webosarchive.lunacy.google/images/google-32x32.png and google-48x48.png: the
  Google account icon from the reference TouchPad (webOS CE 3.1.0; Mojo's shared images,
  mojocommon/mojoImages, HP/Palm, abandonware); the "g" is Google's mark, used to name the
  account type as webOS did.
- accounts/org.webosarchive.lunacy.microsoft/images/microsoft-32x32.png and microsoft-48x48.png:
  Outlook's icon, from a 192 px copy supplied by codepoet (2026-11-05), cropped to its art and
  scaled (Lanczos, premultiplied, a light unsharp mask) into the TouchPad Google icon's margins;
  the Outlook mark is Microsoft's, used to name the account type.
- accounts/org.webosarchive.lunacy.microsoft365/images/: copies of the two Microsoft icons above.
